# Visual verification

If this change can alter rendered output, follow [`docs/VISUAL_VERIFICATION.md`](docs/VISUAL_VERIFICATION.md) before completing the work item.

Use the development `?scenario=` fixtures and Cursor’s built-in browser. Do not invent screenshot, pixel-diff, or external browser-automation tooling.
